  "DivisionNotes": [
    "Operators a, b, c, p, Terminating, Next are placed in ActionDefNames because they prime variables or are disjunctions of such actions; they are therefore excluded from the OperatorDefNames_* partition.",
    "Init is placed in OperatorDefNames_Init because it specifies the initial state of all variables.",
    "Inv is placed in OperatorDefNames_StatePredicate because it is a boolean state predicate (the inductive type invariant) over unprimed variables.",
    "Spec, Termination, and Refines are placed in OperatorDefNames_TemporalProperty because they involve temporal operators (Spec uses [][Next]_vars and WF; Termination uses <>; Refines = R!Spec which is also temporal).",
